    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d745-a1">

                <pb facs="0921" n="819" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg819"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Russell to the Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1908-02-22"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                    1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Minister</hi>: I have the honor to inform your
                    excellency that I have been instructed by my Government to ascertain whether the
                    refusal of Venezuela to accept our proposal of arbitration of pending claims is
                    designed to apply to each and every one of the five claims presented by me on
                    the 30th of March, and, if Venezuela is ready to arbitrate any of those claims,
                    which ones she is willing to arbitrate.</p>
                <p>I take, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">W. W. Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
